# Backups
I've finished writing the script for this, now just want to setup ansible for this.

- Copy borg passfile to /etc/borg/passfile
- Copy backup_containers.sh script to /usr/local/bin/backup_containers.sh
- Initialize borg repo
- Add backup_containers.sh to sudo crontab at 3:30AM

# LVM
Just want a simple role to create the LVM cache and scratch drives in /mnt/nas and /mnt/scratch.
Easiest to hardcode the disk UUIDs for this.
